  "queryImages": [],
  "deprecatedReference": false,
  "deprecatedMatches": {},
  "qid": "233",
  "tip": "<p>When you see predictable time windows, think scheduled actions. Cloud SQL can <i>only</i> autoscale storage, so compute changes require the Admin API triggered by Cloud Scheduler and Cloud Functions or Workflows.</p>",
